            <div xml:id="d216">

                <pb facs="0364" n="270" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.01/211: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Atherton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-03-25T22:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 25,
                                1924—10 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 25—8
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>57. By large majority Deputies today voted dethronement of Glücksburg dynasty and
                    the establishment of a republic, this latter <pb facs="0365" n="271"
                        xml:id="pg271"/> to be confirmed by plebiscite on or about April 13th. Very
                    little enthusiasm.</p>
                <p>I am advised [Roussos?] will become Minister for Foreign Affairs at the end of
                    this week.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Atherton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
